COMMENT ON VIEW public.projection_intervention_outcome_state IS 'B2 Responsible Profitability: casino-grain aggregate of player_protection_interventions (Demo records). No player identifiers. ALL_RECORDED window. Occurrence/outcome only — no delivery timing, no follow-up completion, no causal effectiveness.';


